@startuml SD-UC-K04_PerbaruiBerita
title Sequence Diagram UC-K04: Memperbarui Konten Berita (Admin)
skinparam style strictuml

actor Admin
boundary HalamanDaftarBerita
boundary HalamanFormEditBerita
control BeritaController
entity Berita

activate Admin
Admin -> HalamanDaftarBerita : Mengakses halaman "/admin/berita"
activate HalamanDaftarBerita

HalamanDaftarBerita -> Admin : Tampilkan daftar berita

Admin -> HalamanDaftarBerita : Klik "Edit" (ID_Berita: integer)
HalamanDaftarBerita -> BeritaController : GET /admin/berita/{ID_Berita}
deactivate HalamanDaftarBerita
activate BeritaController

BeritaController -> Berita : findById(ID_Berita: integer)
activate Berita
Berita --> BeritaController : DataKonten: Berita
deactivate Berita

BeritaController -> HalamanFormEditBerita : response(DataKonten)
deactivate BeritaController
activate HalamanFormEditBerita

Admin -> HalamanFormEditBerita : Melakukan perubahan konten

Admin -> HalamanFormEditBerita : Klik "Perbarui"

HalamanFormEditBerita -> BeritaController : PUT /admin/berita/{ID_Berita} (request: object)
activate BeritaController

BeritaController -> Berita : validate(request.data)
activate Berita

BeritaController -> Berita : update(ID_Berita, request.data)
Berita --> BeritaController : UpdateStatus: boolean
deactivate Berita

BeritaController --> HalamanFormEditBerita : responseSuccess(message: string)
deactivate BeritaController

HalamanFormEditBerita -> Admin : Tampilkan notifikasi sukses dan redirect
deactivate HalamanFormEditBerita
deactivate Admin

@enduml